<!--Blurb: Answer to more riddles.-->
<h2 class="h1">The Mind<br/>
Citta Sutta  (SN 1:62)</h2>
<div class="verse">
<pre>“By what 	is the world led?
By what 	is it dragged around?
What 	is the one thing
	that has the all
	under its sway?”</pre>
<pre>“By the mind 	is the world led.
By the mind 	is it dragged around.
The mind 	is the one thing
	that has the all
	under its sway.”</pre>
</div><!--end verse-->
<p class="seealso">See also: <a href="SN35_23.html" class="sutta-ref">SN 35:23</a>; <a href="SN35_82.html" class="sutta-ref">SN 35:82</a>; <a href="../KN/Dhp/Ch01.html#dhp001" class="sutta-ref">Dhp 1–2</a></p>

      </div><!--end:sutta-->
